 │   Approval required · bash                                                 │
 │                                                                            │
 │  $ go test ./...                                                           │
 │  ▸ a · Approve — Run this command                                          │
 │    A · Approve All — Always run similar commands                           │
 │    r · Reject — Skip this command                                          │
 │    R · Reject + Suggest — tell the agent what to do instead                │
 │                                                                            │
 │  1-4 instant · esc rejects · j/k detail                                    │
